        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Granted by the Rising Cosmo feat.</p><p>Increase this effect's value by 1 each time you are critically hit, are reduced to half Hit Points or lower for the first time, or are reduced to 0 Hit Points (maximum 3).</p><p>You gain the value as a status bonus to unarmed Strike damage and to your Technique DCs. At 2 or more you also gain a +1 status bonus to attack rolls and saving throws. At 3, once per round you may Step or Stride 5 feet as a free action when you take damage.</p>"
